00:00:26.740 --> 00:00:29.970
Yeah yeah party people
let's go let's turn it up

00:00:29.970 --> 00:00:33.840
Let's rush in let's send it flying
let's attack let's dash

00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:37.510
The battlefields are sacred,
Bakuretsu Tenshi, Crazy Burst Angel

00:00:37.510 --> 00:00:41.140
They're a bother, they're cheeky,
come on, blast 'em good!

00:00:43.350 --> 00:00:46.590
Everybody, loosey

00:00:46.590 --> 00:00:50.290
Be in full bloom, bluesy

00:00:50.290 --> 00:00:53.630
Vividly, crazy

00:00:53.630 --> 00:00:56.130
Fly up, angel

00:00:56.130 --> 00:00:58.430
We are the risma so charisma

00:00:58.430 --> 00:01:00.470
We soar, really prisma (bomber)

00:01:00.470 --> 00:01:03.010
Hey! It's danceable OK
shake it right now let's go

00:01:03.010 --> 00:01:05.810
Gutsiness let's go beat
let's ride the rhythm tension

00:01:05.810 --> 00:01:07.440
It goes flying frustration

00:01:07.440 --> 00:01:11.550
Alright let's go let's get it on
loosey beauty get your body

00:01:11.550 --> 00:01:15.050
Everybody, loosey

00:01:15.050 --> 00:01:18.560
Be in full bloom, bluesy

00:01:18.560 --> 00:01:21.960
Vividly, crazy

00:01:21.960 --> 00:01:25.290
Fly up, angel

00:01:32.870 --> 00:01:39.280
<i>There was once an era in which
dark ambition ruled over justice.</i>

00:01:39.280 --> 00:01:42.780
<i>Money and power decided
one's life and death;</i>

00:01:42.780 --> 00:01:48.080
<i>it was a lawless town where
powerful beasts devoured the weak.</i>

00:02:02.230 --> 00:02:09.240
<i>No one realized they were possessed
by something unimaginable.</i>

00:02:09.240 --> 00:02:12.500
<i>Time simply marched on.</i>

00:02:24.620 --> 00:02:32.790
<i>Eventually, a leader rose forth
to bring new order to the city.</i>

00:02:38.840 --> 00:02:42.460
<i>An eye for an eye,
a tooth for a tooth...</i>

00:02:45.410 --> 00:02:49.650
<i>And when the steel-fanged
hunting dogs were released,</i>

00:02:49.650 --> 00:02:53.810
<i>the town was swallowed by even
greater destruction and chaos.</i>

00:02:58.220 --> 00:03:00.420
Huh? You already quit?!

00:03:01.050 --> 00:03:04.250
It wasn't a real job...

00:03:05.620 --> 00:03:07.730
--I know!
--Know what?

00:03:07.730 --> 00:03:10.230
I bet they were secretly
involved with the Mafia

00:03:10.230 --> 00:03:13.100
and they forced you
to do dangerous deals!

00:03:14.970 --> 00:03:20.070
But then you wound up saving
some beautiful girls from danger

00:03:20.070 --> 00:03:25.580
and then they said,
"You're the only one who can protect me!"

00:03:25.580 --> 00:03:28.950
As if that could ever happen! Hah!

00:03:28.950 --> 00:03:32.410
You never keep at anything, do ya?

00:03:34.920 --> 00:03:36.660
Looking for another job?

00:03:36.660 --> 00:03:40.220
Um, well, yes...

00:03:41.260 --> 00:03:45.000
It's important to finish
what you started.

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:47.830
I'm sure you could handle it,

00:03:47.830 --> 00:03:53.870
and like they say, "Sleep on a rock
3 years and you'll sleep well!"

00:03:53.870 --> 00:03:56.610
I don't think that's how it goes...

00:03:56.610 --> 00:03:58.910
No, I quit--

00:04:01.450 --> 00:04:05.520
Hello? Eh? Who's this?

00:04:05.520 --> 00:04:09.280
Huh? Look out the window?

00:04:17.060 --> 00:04:20.500
I might not live long enough
to sleep three years...!

00:04:35.480 --> 00:04:39.150
He baked cookies for school today!

00:04:39.150 --> 00:04:43.850
They're super yummy!
Try some when you get back!

00:04:44.760 --> 00:04:47.160
Serious? They're really that good?!

00:04:47.160 --> 00:04:49.030
The best!

00:04:49.030 --> 00:04:53.000
--Save me at least one!
--I don't know...

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:56.170
Eat too much sugar
and you'll be a fatty!

00:04:56.170 --> 00:05:00.510
--Then you don't need any.
--That's not what I meant!

00:05:00.510 --> 00:05:04.540
Let's get this over with.
We're going in now.

00:05:04.540 --> 00:05:08.750
--Do you remember the target's face?
--Eh? What did he look like again?

00:05:08.750 --> 00:05:12.650
--Meg!
--Just kidding! I remember!

00:05:14.020 --> 00:05:16.090
That cook is back?

00:05:16.090 --> 00:05:21.730
I'm glad Sei's worried
about our health and all,

00:05:21.730 --> 00:05:24.330
but I wish she'd rent us
an apartment instead--

00:05:24.330 --> 00:05:25.960
Jo!

00:05:25.960 --> 00:05:29.700
You're to physically restrain him.
Got that?

00:05:29.700 --> 00:05:31.770
Depends on how he acts.

00:05:31.770 --> 00:05:34.810
You can do whatever,
so long as you don't kill him.

00:05:34.810 --> 00:05:36.870
We'll go from the back.

00:05:45.050 --> 00:05:49.450
Damn you! How dare you?!

00:05:54.490 --> 00:06:01.530
Why, you! What're you doing?!
Work, you sewer rats!

00:06:01.530 --> 00:06:05.670
It stinks...! This town is rotten...!

00:06:05.670 --> 00:06:10.070
The moon! The moon is falling!

00:06:17.350 --> 00:06:21.020
--I just stepped in something squishy!
--It's

00:06:21.020 --> 00:06:24.390
Don't tell me! I don't wanna know!

00:06:27.760 --> 00:06:30.730
I did it again!

00:06:30.730 --> 00:06:34.730
--This time it's
--Don't tell me! You're not skeeved?

00:06:34.730 --> 00:06:35.870
Nope.

00:06:35.870 --> 00:06:38.770
--How come?
--I'm not barefoot.

00:06:40.010 --> 00:06:42.640
I bet it was a rat.

00:06:42.640 --> 00:06:44.840
Yeesh.

00:06:44.840 --> 00:06:47.780
You! I know you're there!

00:06:47.780 --> 00:06:51.880
There's no point trying
to kill me! I have friends!

00:06:51.880 --> 00:06:54.690
Found the old rat man.

00:06:54.690 --> 00:06:58.160
Capture him before he gets away.

00:06:58.160 --> 00:07:02.130
I can't stand you!
I'll kill you someday!

00:07:02.130 --> 00:07:06.000
Everything's over! Die!

00:07:06.600 --> 00:07:12.330
I won't run or hide! Hey! Come out!

00:07:13.510 --> 00:07:16.940
This is totally dangerous.
He's completely off his rocker.

00:07:18.040 --> 00:07:20.880
Unnecessary. Stay here.

00:07:27.920 --> 00:07:29.680
It's you...!

00:07:33.660 --> 00:07:35.090
Who is that?

00:07:36.230 --> 00:07:37.500
This is bad.

00:07:37.500 --> 00:07:40.370
Damn you...!

00:07:40.370 --> 00:07:43.940
Perfect timing! I'm just about out...!

00:07:43.940 --> 00:07:46.300
--Who's he?
--Hell if I know.

00:07:46.300 --> 00:07:50.500
--Give it to me.
--You scum...!

00:07:51.510 --> 00:07:52.880
Sleep!

00:08:00.990 --> 00:08:03.720
He's dead! Jo! What do we do?

00:08:03.720 --> 00:08:06.620
That how it looked to you?

00:08:15.400 --> 00:08:20.300
I knew he wasn't dead!
I was just testing you.

00:08:25.780 --> 00:08:29.740
RAPT's outside. It looks
like they're helping.

00:08:33.620 --> 00:08:35.750
Sei. Do you read me?

00:08:35.750 --> 00:08:38.480
Why is RAPT after Wong too?

00:08:42.960 --> 00:08:46.000
I don't know. At any rate,
you need to..

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:48.270
..follow them. I know.

00:08:48.270 --> 00:08:51.700
I'll collect as much info
as I can and send it your way.

00:08:51.700 --> 00:08:55.040
Please clear the road.
Emergency vehicle coming through.

00:08:56.310 --> 00:08:58.300
--I got one!
--Let's go.

00:09:09.150 --> 00:09:13.090
There some reason why
girls like you are followin'

00:09:13.090 --> 00:09:14.930
an ambulance at these hours?

00:09:14.930 --> 00:09:21.860
Yeah! We thought we'd follow
our sick friend to the hospital!

00:09:23.200 --> 00:09:26.610
I have a daughter
about your age myself...

00:09:26.610 --> 00:09:30.210
Have no clue what goes
through that mind of hers...

00:09:30.210 --> 00:09:32.470
Is that so?

00:09:33.140 --> 00:09:34.780
Where are they headed?

00:09:34.780 --> 00:09:39.420
Still don't know.
But it's not the hospital.

00:09:39.420 --> 00:09:42.320
You saying RAPT helped kidnap someone?

00:09:42.320 --> 00:09:44.890
It's a good possibility.

00:09:44.890 --> 00:09:48.560
I don't mean to lecture,
but what would you have done

00:09:48.560 --> 00:09:51.030
if you wound up in trouble
in a place like that?

00:09:51.900 --> 00:09:55.000
Don't be making your parents cry.

00:09:55.000 --> 00:10:01.240
We're fine! Like,
we'd never go anywhere dangerous...

00:10:01.240 --> 00:10:05.180
Yeah? So, is your old man at home?

00:10:06.010 --> 00:10:12.480
My own girl, she sneaks out
to party when I'm not there...

00:10:12.480 --> 00:10:15.490
Guess dads really need to be home...

00:10:15.490 --> 00:10:24.360
I don't think he is.
But I do have annoying sisters.

00:10:24.360 --> 00:10:31.740
Sorry to hear that. But at
least you've got nice sisters.

00:10:31.740 --> 00:10:33.200
Yeah...

00:10:40.010 --> 00:10:42.980
Can you deduce where
the ambulance is headed?

00:10:42.980 --> 00:10:46.780
Shinagawa's industrial area
could mean trouble.

00:10:49.220 --> 00:10:51.480
Sorry, Meg!

00:11:12.340 --> 00:11:16.920
Doesn't it feel like
there might be ghosts here?

00:11:16.920 --> 00:11:19.650
You ever seen a ghost?

00:11:20.490 --> 00:11:23.150
--Not yet...
--Didn't think so.

00:11:23.150 --> 00:11:24.690
Why?!

00:11:24.690 --> 00:11:28.660
--Don't tell me you believe in 'em?
--Of course not!

00:11:28.660 --> 00:11:32.500
We're in front of a small factory
where they took Wong.

00:11:32.500 --> 00:11:35.030
Looks like an
industrial chemical lab.

00:11:35.030 --> 00:11:38.330
The data says it was
closed down two years ago.

00:11:40.040 --> 00:11:41.510
Can you get inside?

00:11:41.510 --> 00:11:43.570
Yeah. We'll try.

00:11:46.280 --> 00:11:49.180
Um, I finished your dinner...

00:11:49.180 --> 00:11:51.380
Thanks. We appreciate it.

00:11:51.380 --> 00:11:56.690
Um... I'd like tonight to be my last,
if possible...

00:11:56.690 --> 00:11:59.350
Everyone really relies on you!

00:12:00.760 --> 00:12:04.760
We all think your cooking is wonderful!

00:12:04.760 --> 00:12:06.430
You do?

00:12:06.430 --> 00:12:10.100
--See you tomorrow.
--Right!

00:12:10.100 --> 00:12:14.130
Microwave the fried rice and dumplings
when you're ready, then!

00:12:57.150 --> 00:12:58.840
Easy as pie!

00:13:06.760 --> 00:13:09.430
Those guys are totally suspicious.

00:13:09.430 --> 00:13:12.060
Looks like they
weren't ghosts after all.

00:13:12.060 --> 00:13:15.830
I bet they're some freaky murder gang...

00:13:15.830 --> 00:13:19.000
You have too wild of an imagination.

00:13:22.410 --> 00:13:27.210
There's a strong EM signal ahead.
I've lost the ambulance.

00:13:27.210 --> 00:13:28.750
Huh?

00:13:28.750 --> 00:13:31.080
It looks like there's
something underground.

00:14:04.280 --> 00:14:08.010
We've located the ambulance.
Now to find Wong--

00:14:17.200 --> 00:14:21.660
What's he doing in this thing?

00:14:23.500 --> 00:14:25.830
Knock it off, Jo...!

00:14:26.770 --> 00:14:28.710
Who are you?!

00:14:32.580 --> 00:14:36.980
--Why'd you kill him?!
--No! It wasn't us!

00:14:36.980 --> 00:14:39.580
Some guys in white killed him!

00:14:39.580 --> 00:14:44.490
Don't lie! I saw you take
the back alley to get him!

00:14:44.490 --> 00:14:47.030
You were gonna kill him from the start!

00:14:47.030 --> 00:14:51.830
No! Those guys showed up before us!

00:14:51.830 --> 00:14:56.900
--So you're not involved?
--No! Not one bit!

00:14:56.900 --> 00:15:02.600
Then what's that hole in his chest?
You shot him, didn't you?!

00:15:03.610 --> 00:15:05.380
He's not dead yet.

00:15:05.380 --> 00:15:09.810
Don't give me that crap!
I'll blow this chick's head off!

00:15:10.880 --> 00:15:14.220
Now tell me! Why'd you kill him?!

00:15:14.220 --> 00:15:16.310
Someone put you up to it?!

00:15:17.490 --> 00:15:22.360
If so, then tell me who! Now!

00:15:23.490 --> 00:15:24.900
Let her go.

00:15:24.900 --> 00:15:30.130
J-Jo! Let's just do what he says!

00:15:30.130 --> 00:15:34.740
I don't think he'd understand,
so there's no point explaining!

00:15:34.740 --> 00:15:40.110
Alright! Yes, you're right!
We killed him! Hurray!

00:15:40.110 --> 00:15:42.050
We haven't done anything yet.

00:15:43.010 --> 00:15:46.450
Jo! He's gonna blow my head off!

00:15:46.450 --> 00:15:49.180
Then let him, if he dares!

00:15:50.120 --> 00:15:51.420
Jo!

00:15:51.420 --> 00:15:56.050
--Fine by me.
--Stop! Stop! Stop! Stop!

00:16:07.840 --> 00:16:11.810
Who are you? You with
those guys in white?

00:16:11.810 --> 00:16:13.870
Or maybe RAPT?

00:16:16.810 --> 00:16:20.250
This way! Exterminate the intruders!

00:16:24.160 --> 00:16:26.020
Don't resist!

00:16:26.020 --> 00:16:28.860
Give up and do as we say!

00:16:38.000 --> 00:16:39.630
Why, you...!

00:16:42.840 --> 00:16:44.030
Meg!

00:16:54.320 --> 00:16:56.190
Fools.

00:16:56.190 --> 00:16:59.160
They have Wong
inside a specimen capsule!

00:16:59.160 --> 00:17:01.420
It's out of our hands now!

00:17:10.170 --> 00:17:13.500
No way! What's this doing here?!

00:17:13.500 --> 00:17:17.210
Oh no! Now there's a cybot, too!

00:17:17.210 --> 00:17:19.180
Shouldn't we send Django?

00:17:19.180 --> 00:17:23.080
We can't make any moves
until we figure out why

00:17:23.080 --> 00:17:25.950
RAPT is guarding
Wong's body so closely.

00:17:25.950 --> 00:17:28.620
We have to be extra careful
not to show our true colors.

00:17:28.620 --> 00:17:34.520
Grownups are so useless when
they analyze stuff too much.

00:17:35.790 --> 00:17:40.230
What if there's something special
about Wong's body itself...?

00:17:43.800 --> 00:17:45.860
The old guy's gone!

00:17:48.970 --> 00:17:52.140
Seems this was a relay point.

00:17:52.140 --> 00:17:55.710
--Meg. Go below.
--Eh? How come?

00:17:55.710 --> 00:17:56.610
Got a hunch.

00:17:58.180 --> 00:17:59.450
What are you gonna do?

00:17:59.450 --> 00:18:03.020
--I'll meet up with you later.
--Roger!

00:18:03.020 --> 00:18:05.180
After this fight!

00:18:35.550 --> 00:18:37.780
Hurry up!

00:18:40.360 --> 00:18:42.160
Ugh...!

00:18:47.100 --> 00:18:48.700
Out.

00:18:48.700 --> 00:18:50.500
I got it!

00:18:50.500 --> 00:18:54.970
Hinode Pharmaceuticals bought the factory
and purposely neglected it!

00:18:54.970 --> 00:18:57.540
Once things quieted down, they
brought in research equipment

00:18:57.540 --> 00:19:00.410
and had RAPT guard it!

00:19:00.410 --> 00:19:03.010
Hinode Pharmaceuticals? Isn't that--

00:19:03.010 --> 00:19:06.180
Yeah! The one with
that cybot commercial!

00:19:06.180 --> 00:19:09.490
Your problems are my pain!

00:19:09.490 --> 00:19:14.690
Let us help you!
Hinode Pharmaceuticals!

00:19:14.690 --> 00:19:18.860
If they're behind Wong's kidnapping,

00:19:18.860 --> 00:19:21.800
that means they were involved
with RAPT beforehand.

00:19:21.800 --> 00:19:27.410
And it looks like that's where they
used to store medicine for delivery.

00:19:27.410 --> 00:19:31.980
There's data about a
transportation network here.

00:19:31.980 --> 00:19:34.880
They shipped to all of Japan from here!

00:19:36.680 --> 00:19:39.210
All of Japan?!

00:20:00.910 --> 00:20:04.900
A secret train? Totally cool!

00:20:09.080 --> 00:20:11.480
Meg! I'm coming!

00:20:22.690 --> 00:20:27.190
Alright! I can take action
too sometimes!

00:20:28.370 --> 00:20:29.660
Don't move!

00:20:32.700 --> 00:20:33.860
What the...?!

00:20:40.580 --> 00:20:41.980
Hurry!

00:20:41.980 --> 00:20:43.780
Meg! You okay?!

00:20:43.780 --> 00:20:46.380
W-What's going on?!

00:20:53.590 --> 00:20:55.150
Meg!

00:21:04.000 --> 00:21:06.470
Jo! Hurry!

00:21:24.760 --> 00:21:26.990
We meet again.

00:21:31.330 --> 00:21:34.230
This can't be happening...!

00:21:57.770 --> 00:22:05.450
I remained motionless within the crowd

00:22:05.450 --> 00:22:13.090
Not even the voice of my
tears carried on this street

00:22:13.090 --> 00:22:20.790
as my feelings of lonesomeness joined it

00:22:20.790 --> 00:22:30.170
In truth, everyone wants
to smile with each other,

00:22:30.170 --> 00:22:36.710
yet they get hurt
when they can't do it very well

00:22:36.710 --> 00:22:45.790
But someone will always
be there to watch,

00:22:45.790 --> 00:22:52.890
so let's walk together
beneath this sky

00:23:13.780 --> 00:23:17.250
<i>The speeding train rushes
toward a trampled future.</i>

00:23:17.250 --> 00:23:21.620
<i>Jo takes flight as it
nears its final destination.</i>

00:23:21.620 --> 00:23:27.860
<i>On the next Burst Angel:</i>
"Brothers Die at Dawn"
